    "title": "Nut n Bolt Sort: Color Puzzle",
    "description": "Are you a puzzle master and logic lover? Get ready to break your brainpower in the colorful Nut n Bolt Sort: Color Puzzle challenge now. \r\n\r\nIn Nut n Bolt Sort: Color Puzzle, grab those colorful nuts & bolts and strategically stack them onto their corresponding bolts, one by one. Think ahead, plan your moves carefully, and become the master of Nut n Bolt Sort: Color Puzzle.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY: \r\n\u26a1 Tap and move the nut and bolt.\r\n\u26a1 Match the colors of the nut and bolt correctly\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Hundreds of challenging levels.\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Unlockable power-ups.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Relaxing yet stimulating.\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Brainpower booster.\r\n\r\nSo, ready to unleash your inner sorter? Download Nut n Bolt Sort: Color Puzzle today and let the brain games begin!",
